# The `kurt` command.
#
#   kurt new blog
#   cd blog
#   kurt generate scaffold Post title:string body:text published:bool
#   kurt db:migrate
#   kurt dev
#
# Build it with `make` in the Kurt checkout (bin/kurt).
module cmd/kurt

